    </TIER>
    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="Translation"  TIER_ID="trx_en@SPK0031">
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1228"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts25">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yesterday, remember that Zulyash kudagi said [they] were going to have their first baby only now [at this age], after having chased studies.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1252"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts33" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts36">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1257"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts41" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts45">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Don't you remember, she said this about one kelinshek?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a976"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts53" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts66">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Unfortune! It started raining again, silently. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a982"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts69" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts72">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh Allah!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a382"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts73" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts114">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh, that...once, initially on the month of May or in the beginning of July, people blustered, you know, saying "oh, there will be frought because the sun will soar".</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a408"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts127" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts132">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What drought are you talking about?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a409"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts133" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts140">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Now is the time for mowning grass.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a410"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts143" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts152">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It will become possible to mow the grass after this.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a411"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts155" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts172">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Darkhan went there and just now said to me that there is rain [in the village].</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a412"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts183" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts192">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes, in Kurshim. It is raining there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a413"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts205" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts237">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know the place where Zharkyn sows watermelons? He said he went there and gave tasattyk.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a414"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts244" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts266">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>After that, yes...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a415"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts267" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts284">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, yesterday, it happened that Zholaman spoke to me when he was at that thing...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a416"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts290" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts307">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We are two at Zharkyn's with...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a417"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts324" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts329">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Who?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a580"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts343" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts347">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He does not borrow money.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a581"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts349" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts355">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Lie...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a591"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts360" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts376">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He doesn't borrow money. He is just prattling, meh.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a592"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts397" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts425">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, where would he spend this money? Of course, he will hire someone to dig a well or do something on the land.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a582"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts430" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts436">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Gosh.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a593"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts439" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts469">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He said that he and Zhomash together are at his place. He said that Zhomash was saying hi to me when we were talking.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a667"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts477" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts488">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes, Zhomash.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a668"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts493" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts498">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Isabek.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a669"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts505" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts533">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Zholaman said that his grandmother is good and that she just yesterday came to visit his place.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a738"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts565" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts576">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, this is it. Here it is raining, and the grey clouds.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a739"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts581" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts590">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Even if the clouds are small, the rain from them falls heavily.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a740"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts604" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts615">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It is raining, it is raining.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a801"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts624" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts627">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It will be good.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a802"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts630" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts640">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>There will no be drought in Kurshim.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a803"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts673" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts676">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He said he will go to this one place here to speak with somebody and will come back.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a804"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts683" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts697">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[He] will film a movie called kempir shal.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a887"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts714" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts724">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, don't you see he, Akalok, is filming a movie called kempir shal?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a888"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts727" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts761">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He says: "[these are] my maternal grandfather and maternal ganmother; one of them is 80, the other is 70, at their time when they are trembling, being filmed for a movie"</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a889"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts767" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts770">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes, yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
