        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1639"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1125" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1145">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Malim and others the people related to him and all of his children went to school, you know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1645"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1154" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1160">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1681"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1200" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1215">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>These times were different, you know. You're so weird (you speak weird things).</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1691"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1221" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1232">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Even if he stored stuff or not, it would not have mattered for him because there he did his best as much as possible.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1695"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1235" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1252">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>His had such a dream, saying "if only I had my own firewood and cattle", and he was busy with this.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1711"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1257" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1267">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>These are different times now, you know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1740"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1281" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1298">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know, this is called living on the same wave like others according to one's time/age/epoch.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1747"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1303" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1308">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>This is called living on the same wave like others according to the standards of one's time/age/epoch.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1758"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1313" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1324">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>At his time (age), he did not fell behind from anybody (he lived like others).</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1766"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1327" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1334">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He was a tractor driver in stock (in reserve).</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1776"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1335" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1353">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But now, the time as we call it (descibe it), is now...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1824"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1379" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1415">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I am thinking now, and I think that our labour at that time, turns out,  was as as enourmous as a sea. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1855"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1453" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1475">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, it is because.. for example...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1887"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1481" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1498">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>For example, if there are six to five chidlren in total, just please think...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1906"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1503" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1529">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If my friend ## sits on the tractor all day, from morning till evening, how is her wife supposed to work?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1918"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1536" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1542">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You please stop it!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1919"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1545" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1548">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>There were!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1928"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1551" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1554">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Not necessary</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1932"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1557" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1570">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>At home you cannot NOT do anything; you're so weird you know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1953"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1595" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1598">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>At kontor.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1964"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1601" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1618">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, yes, at the safhoz's kontor and at the medical, there were jobs.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1978"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1623" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1642">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, yes, there is a job of teachers' janitor at school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2000"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1645" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1664">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, but even on days when let's says there were jobs available, then how would a woman work when she had no fewer than four to five kids?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2010"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1669" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1680">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He himself is rich and also breeds cattle.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2021"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1683" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1694">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In that case, how could you possibly be on duty (i.e., work)? What would you do?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2030"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1697" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1716">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Then ther were not washing machines. Everything was done by hands. Everyone milked cattle.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2043"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1719" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1724">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She [you] says women did not work at that time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2048"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1729" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1732">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Women did work!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2044"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1735" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1758">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Raising that many children, making sure they studied and got married - it is all your durty, and this is called work.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
    </TIER>
    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="Translation"  TIER_ID="trx_en@SPK0032">
        <ANNOTATION>
